        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-710, Distressed Heavy Egg Shaped Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe egg shape of this knob is a time-honored classic. It catches the eye with classic beauty. RK International's Distressed Egg Shaped Cabinet Knob has character from the distressing which shows off the highlights of the 6 available finishes. It measures 1-13/16 inches long and 15/16 inches wide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/distressed-oval-knob-rose-rk-international-bp-488\"><b>Distressed Oval Knob Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-710 Simple Egg Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TR100_size.gif?v=1704354719\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
